WHY THIS AND NOT MIT

  A permissive licence would let anyone ship this exact portfolio under their
  own name. For a personal portfolio that is the one outcome worth preventing,
  so the default of "all rights reserved" is stated explicitly rather than left
  to be inferred from the absence of a LICENSE file.

  If you would rather this be open source, replacing this file with the MIT
  text is the only change required — nothing in the build depends on it.

